nded Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Two_Handed_Sword_90f1f9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Helmet\"><img alt=\"Iron Helmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Iron_Helmet_0bb895.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Bone Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bone_Shield_4f7661.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"DeeperCatacombs\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"107\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/DeeperCatacombs_56a949.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.10<br/>December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nIn the southeast part of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>, next to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Carpet\">magic carpet</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Boat\">boat</a>, there is an entrance to the Deeper Catacombs.\n</p><p>The Catacombs hold the coffins of many old darashian families.\n</p>\n<div style=\"padding-top:1px;overflow:auto\">\n<p>In order to reach the lower levels, you must turn off some lights, use the sundial and go down the secret stairs inside a coffin in the room to the south-west.<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Koshei Quest Entrance\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"531\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Koshei_Quest_Entrance_6dad60.jpg\" width=\"727\"/></span><br/>\nAfter going down, the stairs will dissapear and the lights will turn on again.\n<br/>A part of the Tibia Tales Quest can be found here.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures_at_the_Deeper_Catacombs\">Creatures at the Deeper Catacombs</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>-1 floor</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rat\"><img alt=\"Rat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rat_df2b53.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Rat\">Rat</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: cen